<hor. epod. 6.1>	Quid inmerentis hospites vexas, canis
<hor. epod. 6.2>	ignavos adversum lupos?
<hor. epod. 6.3>	quin huc inanis, si potes, vertis minas
<hor. epod. 6.4>	et me remorsurum petis?
<hor. epod. 6.5>	nam qualis aut Molossus aut fulvos Lacon,
<hor. epod. 6.6>	amica vis pastoribus,
<hor. epod. 6.7>	agam per altas aure sublata nivis
<hor. epod. 6.8>	quaecumque praecedet fera;
<hor. epod. 6.9>	tu, cum timenda voce complesti nemus,
<hor. epod. 6.10>	proiectum odoraris cibum.
<hor. epod. 6.11>	cave, cave, namque in malos asperrimus
<hor. epod. 6.12>	parata tollo cornua,
<hor. epod. 6.13>	qualis Lycambae spretus infido gener
<hor. epod. 6.14>	aut acer hostis Bupalo.
<hor. epod. 6.15>	an si quis atro dente me petiverit,
<hor. epod. 6.16>	inultus ut flebo puer?
